a"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":66,"first_line":"nitāi guṇamaṇi āmāra","author":"Śrīla Lochan Dās Ṭhākur"},"title":["Nitāi guṇamaṇi āmāra"],"author":["by Śrīla Lochan Dās Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["nitāi guṇamaṇi āmāra nitāi guṇamaṇi","āniyā premera vanyā bhāsāla avanī"],"translation":["Nitāi, the jewel of all good qualities, my Nitāi, the jewel of all good qualities, brought a flood of divine love and inundated the earth."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["prema-vanyā laye nitāi āila gauḍa-deśe","ḍubila bhakata-gaṇa dīna-hīna bhāse"],"translation":["Nitāi brought a flood of divine love to the land of Gauḍa. The devotees immersed themselves in it, but the unfortunate floated on its surface."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["dīna-hīna patita pāmara nāhi bāchhe","brahmāra durlabha prema sabākāre yāche"],"translation":["The sinful, unfortunate, and fallen did not desire this divine love, which is difficult for even Brahmā to attain, yet Nitāi begged them to accept it."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["ābaddha karuṇā-sindhu kāṭiyā muhāna","ghare ghare bule prema-amiyāra vāna"],"translation":["Nitāi cut a canal into the sealed ocean of mercy and a flood of nectarean divine love spread to every home."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["lochan bale hena nitāi yebā nā bhajila","jāniyā śuniyā sei ātma-ghātī haila"],"translation":["Lochan Dās says, “Anyone who did not serve Nitāi knowingly committed suicide.”"],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Nabadwip temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/navadwip-scsm-nitai-guna-mani","personSlug":"nabadwip-temple"},{"title":"Srila B.N. Acharya Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/kostya-netrebenko/034-nitaigunamaniamara-3","personSlug":"srila-b-n-acharya-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/nitai-gunamani","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Sudarshan Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/sudarshan-prabhu-nitai","personSlug":"sudarshan-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Nitāi-guṇamaṇi-āmāra-02-22"},"head":{"canonical":"/en-pe/nitai-gunamani-amara-nitai-gunamani/","description":"Nitāi guṇamaṇi āmāra — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Lochan Dās Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Pocket Kirtan Guide.","title":"Nitāi guṇamaṇi āmāra. by Śrīla Lochan Dās Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-pe","slug":"nitai-gunamani-amara-nitai-gunamani"}}